== Std.SystemUtils: the program and its system (change datetime-systemutils,
== canon r3.92, decision D4 of Marcelo Fortes, 2026-10-21). Compiler
== intrinsics carried out by libinoxrt, visible in a program that uses this
== module, so their names stay free elsewhere. Text is UTF-8 on every system.
==
==   ParamCount Integer           == the arguments after the program's own name
==   ParamStr(I Integer) String   == ParamStr(0) the program, ParamStr(1) the first argument;
==                                == outside 0..ParamCount: "value out of range"
==   GetEnv(Name String) String   == an environment variable; "" when it is not set
==   EnvExists(Name String) Bool  == whether it is set (also to "")
==   Halt(Code Integer)           == ends the program now with exit status Code, 0..255
==                                == (else "value out of range"); the terminal is given back
==   Sleep(Ms Integer)            == waits Ms milliseconds; what was written is shown first
==   CurrentDir String            == the working directory
==   PlatformName String          == "Linux", "Windows", "macOS", "FreeBSD", ...
==
== Running another program comes after 1.0.
